{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She begins to head up and joins Cato","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:47:09.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740264582563758116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"What is your name? I have seen you around, but haven't met.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:47:51.060000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740264755058704505","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She gives a small bow \"I'm Lilia Baker.\" Then sits down next to him","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:48:41.658000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740264967282098237","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I've been trying to meet many of you colonists. All of the names have been getting hard to remember.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:49:14.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740265106755289198","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Mine is plenty simple. Cato. Just. Cato\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:50:30.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740265424150724681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Cato.\" she repeats the name.","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:50:58.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740265540244996218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"What are your plans for being here?\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:51:26.461000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740265658515980458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"The future. I have a young daughter. And an exspouse. They left to never return leaving me alone. I don't have the option to sulk, however. The town needs me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:53:38.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740266213120409661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She listens \"It is honorable of you to want to keep going for the sake of your daughter and this town..\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:55:02.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740266565513117718","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I'm sorry to hear about your exspouse however.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:55:50.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740266765371703316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Me too. Love may be false no matter how true it seems at the time. What about you? Why are you in Roanoke?\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:56:36.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740266957848182874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I don't consider myself to be... I was on a ship that crashed..\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:57:36.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740267211725209754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I am not of your colony... I've been here for quite sometime.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T17:58:09.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740267350670180435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
