{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I will look out for him then.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:08:37.189000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-04T18:08:57.870000Z","id":"740269981702291587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I hope I'll be of use to you all. Like I said, I have been here for quite some time so I'm sure you all can find a use for me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:10:04.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740270349891010601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"You are always welcome to see me. I... could use the company.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:10:36.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740270481604739124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"He stares off into the woods with a look of longing. Unsure of what he is longing for","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:11:06.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740270608251617402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Lilia stays quiet for a moment \"You seem like someone who wants to carry all the weight of the world by themselves...\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:13:24.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740271184951902311","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"The more I do. The less others need to. I have the ability to lessen the weight on their shoulders, and put it on my own instead.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:14:25.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740271442423316491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"He feels the warmth of the cloak around him. And remembers how cold it is everytime he takes it off to help another","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:14:54.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740271564074909727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"People also have the ability to lessen the weight you carry.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:15:52.095000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740271805830266973","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"It makes more sense for many to work together than for one to suffer... It may not work out to be an equal distribution but people want to feel helpful and do what they can.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:17:23.937000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740272191043797022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"It can be difficult for me to reach out. I don't like owing people, I hate to steal from them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:18:55.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740272574705041528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"If they offer, nothing is owed and nothing is stolen. Some may offer willingly when asked and other may not. You never know unless you ask. People can surprise you in ways you'll never see coming.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:20:42.086000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-04T18:20:47.518000Z","id":"740273022140940350","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I have met only a handful of your colony, but It's clear to me that you all want to build something secure and that you all care deeply about each others survival here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:22:01.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740273355474600056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"We do. It is very important to everyone that we create something safe. There will be a town meeting in the afternoon to discuss the future. I hope you will be there.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:22:58.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740273592293654528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I can try to make it. I don't consider myself apart of you all, I have formed my own relations on this island and I don't wish for that to be taken away. But I will also need to form my own with your people, given that we are neighbors after all.\" She gestures to a small grove of trees just outside of the towns limits.","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:26:03.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740274371083370598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I shall visit sometime.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:26:27.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740274472937980312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Please do. Even with all of these people no one has yet to even stumble upon my home.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T18:27:13.625000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-04T18:27:37.452000Z","id":"740274664374272022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
